OL,3,GNEWSACouple and two children killed in
OL,4,Aarson attack named locally
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour family members, including two
OL,7,Fchildren, who died following an arson
OL,8,Fattack on their home in County
OL,9,FWaterford have been named locally.
OL,11,FKim English, Philip English and their
OL,12,Fchildren, 12-year-old Callum and
OL,13,Fnine-year-old Jayden, died in the house
OL,14,Ffire on Birch Avenue, on the outskirts
OL,15,Fof Waterford in the Republic of
OL,16,FIreland.
OL,18,FA "multiple murder" investigation has
OL,19,Fbeen launched by gardai (Irish police)
OL,20,Ffollowing the blaze.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
